  "quantizer_orthogonality": {
    "note": "RepQ-ViT's matched-BOPs wins over TANDEM at its two published cost points (w6a6, w8a8; all 4 models) reflect a quantizer-quality difference -- RepQ-ViT's reparameterized PTQ pipeline vs TANDEM's own simple per-block symmetric quantizer -- not allocation regret. Uniform-bit, r=0 configurations already lie inside TANDEM's own (r, per-block-bits) plan search space, so TANDEM's allocator is not structurally prevented from reaching this region; RepQ-ViT simply quantizes better at a given nominal bit-width than TANDEM's current quantizer does.",
