    "stated_limitation": "TANDEM's current quantizer (static per-tensor symmetric weight/activation quantization) is less sophisticated than RepQ-ViT's reparameterized, scale-search PTQ pipeline -- this is a quantizer-implementation limitation of TANDEM's current codebase, not evidence against TANDEM's cost-allocation search.",
    "future_work": "Composability: pairing TANDEM's own (r, bits)-allocation search with a stronger per-block quantizer (e.g. RepQ-ViT's reparameterization) is left as future work; the two contributions are orthogonal."
